cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pdata.world data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "pdata.world: prediction-market prices, volumes and results from eight venues"
authors:
  - name: "pdata.world"
    website: "https://pdata.world"
abstract: >-
  Prices, 24-hour volume and results for prediction markets on Polymarket,
  Kalshi, Manifold, Myriad, Limitless, Predict, Opinion and Gemini, collected
  every 10 to 60 minutes and served through a read-only API, an MCP server,
  nightly bulk files and a public read-only Postgres database.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23211611"
url: "https://pdata.world/data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/noskillcoding/pdata-client"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
keywords:
  - prediction markets
  - Polymarket
  - Kalshi
  - Manifold
  - forecasting
  - open data
